Conflicts: ffmpeg-ma
Replaces: ffmpeg-ma
Provides: ffmpeg-ma
Description: FFmpeg binary with patches from MediaArea.net
 FFmpeg binary and shared libraries with patches from MediaArea.net.

Package: ffmpeg-ma-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ffmpeg-ma (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: FFmpeg with patches from MediaArea.net - development files
 FFmpeg binary and shared libraries with patches from MediaArea.net.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the pkg-config files and the examples
 needed to compile and link applications using the libav*-ma and libsw*-ma
 libraries.
